# Databases and local data
# NOTE: do NOT ignore data/ wholesale. It holds the committed CSV fixtures
# (cars.csv, dealers.csv) that the repositories and tests are seeded from.
# Ignoring the directory would hide those fixtures from git entirely, and no
# `!data/...` exception can rescue them: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded. Scope the rule to the file types instead.
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite
chroma_db/
vectorstore/
*.pkl
*.pickle

# Project-specific
PLAN.md
.envrc
